config BR2_PACKAGE_FROST_STRESS
	bool "frost-stress"
	help
	  FROST userspace boot stress payload. Runs once at boot from
	  inittab: timer storm + signal delivery, vfork/exec context
	  switching, futex ping-pong over a MAP_SHARED file mapping,
	  lock-free LR/SC contention between two processes, and Zicntr
	  counter deltas (cycles/instret/time + IPC) around a fixed
	  workload, degrading to counters=unavailable where the counters
	  are not U-readable (QEMU). Prints the
	  FROST_USERSPACE_STRESS_PASS/_FAIL token that the QEMU CI job
	  and the hardware boot soak assert on.
